Values
Value	Given
void-os command	void-os
view operand	view
version	0.1.0
usage message	usage: void-os [view [--filter filter] [input [day [position]]] | hook-event]
data bank folder	void-os
data bank variable	VOID_OS_DATA_BANK
lock timeout	60
lock wait	0.05
replace suffix	.tmp
server name	void-os
server instructions	void-os keeps your memory in its data bank at {data bank folder}. Read it, or any file or directory, with read.
tool name	read
tool description	Read a file, a directory of files, or the data bank, as MTSV text: a tab between fields, a line break between records, a form feed before each sheet's name. Every reply begins with the report; then the field names of each sheet, or, with a selection, its values.
hook input schema	{"title": "hook input", "type": "object"}
context limit	10000
pager variable	PAGER
column gap	 
